ght-sprint-qualifying-with-antonelli-fifth/10847948/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-f8b20f718b92c5117603b73fc996909d39664488057fc753d7f25b6e0d5b757c","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"F1首度造访马德里Madring赛道：维斯塔潘简短回应，事故少于预期","summaryZh":"F1首次在IFEMA会展中心周边的马德里赛道（Madring）举行比赛，围场内此前担心的混乱并未出现。F3和F2 sessions中出现了多起撞车事故，甚至有一辆赛车起火，但F1方面在西班牙大奖赛期间唯一的事故是Arvid Lindblad的一次撞车。目前来看，Madring并未成为“赛车杀手”。Max Verstappen对这条新赛道作出了简短而耐人寻味的回应。","publishedAt":"2026-09-11T20:10:53.864Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-11T18:00:32.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-2.motorsport.com/images/amp/27NoKlx0/s6/max-verstappen-red-bull-racing.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":174376,"altZh":"F1首度造访马德里Madring赛道：维斯塔潘简短回应，事故少于预期"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/max-verstappens-short-but-telling-reaction-to-f1s-new-madrid-circuit/10854695/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}}]}